    <h2 id="mission-title" class="display h2 c-text" data-reveal>What we mean by smarter</h2>
    <div class="prose c-text mission-body" data-reveal-group>
      <p data-reveal>
        Answers are easy to find now. Understanding still takes work. You can read a clear
        explanation, feel that you’ve got it, and a week later find you can’t explain it or use
        it. The feeling of having learned is not the same as knowing.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal>
        Anybody Is Genius is built for knowing: ideas you can put in your own words, use on a
        problem you haven’t seen before, and still have next month. A little of that, every day,
        is what we mean by 1% smarter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
